{
  "_comment": "Laptop run without a GPU (RUN_LOCAL.md): same model, adapter and prompt as configs/serve.json, on the CPU and only on 127.0.0.1. Start with SCRABLE_CPU_BF16=1 for bfloat16 (about 3.5 GB of memory).",
  "base": {
    "backend": "local",
